OL,3,CBus driver, 25, shot dead outside pub
OL,4,Cin south London named by police
OL,6,FA 25-year-old bus driver shot dead
OL,7,Foutside a pub in south London has been
OL,8,Fnamed by police.Gunshots were heard
OL,9,Fnear the venue in Willington Road,
OL,10,FClapham, on Monday evening.
OL,12,FAuguste-Marie Bile-aka Amoa was named
OL,13,Fby the Metropolitan Police as the
OL,14,Fvictim of the attack.
OL,16,FShortly after the shooting, a 22-year-
OL,17,Fold man attended hospital with a
OL,18,Fgunshot wound and was arrested on
OL,19,Fsuspicion of murder, according to the
OL,20,Fforce.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/7
