PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786915123
OL,3,CBus driver, 25, shot dead outside pub
OL,4,Cin south London named by police
OL,6,FHe remains in hospital under police
OL,7,Fguard.
OL,9,FDetective Chief Inspector Claire
OL,10,FGuiver, who is leading the
OL,11,Finvestigation, said: "Our thoughts
OL,12,Fremain with Bile-aka's family as they
OL,13,Fcome to terms with this tragic
OL,14,Fincident.
OL,16,F"We continue to appeal for anyone with
OL,17,Finformation to come forward.
OL,26,@sD@VOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/7
