CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786915123
OL,3,CBus driver, 25, shot dead outside pub
OL,4,Cin south London named by police
OL,6,F"If you were in the area at the time
OL,7,Fof the shooting, witnessed anything
OL,8,Fsuspicious or have any CCTV, dashcam
OL,9,For doorbell footage that could assist
OL,10,Four investigation, we urge you to get
OL,11,Fin touch.
OL,13,F"Any piece of information could prove
OL,14,Fvital in helping us piece together the
OL,15,Ffull circumstances."
OL,17,FSpeaking near the scene, a friend of
OL,18,Fthe victim described him as a "cool
OL,19,Fguy", adding that he believed the
OL,20,Fdeath was the result of "wrong place,
OL,21,Fwrong time".
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOUwD@TO]zD@_OU{D@DO]|D@YOU}D@
OL,26,AKO]
