OL,3,CBus driver, 25, shot dead outside pub
OL,4,Cin south London named by police
OL,6,FHe said: "I don't have bad things to
OL,7,Fsay about him.
OL,9,F"He's a cool guy, like I said, bus
OL,10,Fdriver, hard-working.
OL,12,F"It's shocking because of who he is
OL,13,Fand his character."
OL,15,FThe man, who also works as a bus
OL,16,Fdriver, said the death is "going to
OL,17,Fhurt a lot of people".
OL,26,@nD@JOUqD@AOUtD@AOUuD@SO]xD@[OUyD@UO]
