OL,3,CBus driver, 25, shot dead outside pub
OL,4,Cin south London named by police
OL,6,FA police forensics tent was still in
OL,7,Fplace across the road from The Landor
OL,8,Fpub on Tuesday while several bouquets
OL,9,Fof flowers were laid and a candle was
OL,10,Flit near its entrance.
OL,12,FStaff from The Landor are understood
OL,13,Fto have helped the victim after the
OL,14,Fshooting.
OL,16,FA 26-year-old woman living nearby said
OL,17,Fshe heard four gunshots and initially
OL,18,Fthought it was the sound of a car
OL,19,Fbackfiring.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/7
