PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786915123
OL,3,CBus driver, 25, shot dead outside pub
OL,4,Cin south London named by police
OL,6,FTwo other residents described hearing
OL,7,Ffour gunshots at around 10pm on Monday
OL,8,Fand seeing a car with a broken window.
OL,10,FOne man, who did not wish to be named,
OL,11,Fsaid he heard three gunshots and saw
OL,12,Fsomeone run out of the pub and shout
OL,13,F"call the police".
OL,15,FHe said he saw a moped and a white car
OL,16,Fdrive off before the police arrived,
OL,17,Fand that women could be heard
OL,18,F"screaming and crying" outside.
OL,26,@uD@AOUuD@QO]zD@AOUzD@VO]
